+## 7. Review 03 — Erratum 01
+
+[Erratum 01](DURANKI-v1.2-C01-ERRATUM-01.md) is the governing author correction to this map's earlier binding and fence wording. G-01 moves only server assessments out of canonical work, retaining caller assertions and stable trusted identity. G-02 restores plan-key custody, rotation and revocation. N-01 replaces commit-inside-fence with durable commit, coherent fence-protected publication, then acknowledgement. N-04 extends T-48.g with per-attempt rounding. N-03 does not trigger another prose cycle. N-02 is partially addressed by [the evidence supplement](DURANKI-v1.2-C01-EVIDENCE-SUPPLEMENT-01.md) and remains open for final DEV-08–DEV-10/late DEV-07 records. All are author dispositions, not independent closure or owner adoption.
